# Code Reuse - REQUIRED

Before creating ANY new code, check these locations:

| Need | Check First |
|------|-------------|
| UI Components | `src/app/shared/components/ui/` |
| Validators | `src/app/shared/validators/` |
| Pipes | `src/app/shared/pipes/` |
| Directives | `src/app/shared/directives/` |
| Core Services | `src/app/core/services/` |
| Auth | `src/app/core/auth/` |
| Models | `src/app/models/` |

---

# Naming Conventions

| Type | Convention | Example |
|------|------------|---------|
| Component selector | `app-` + kebab-case | `app-gas-card` |
| Directive selector | `app` + camelCase | `appHighlight` |
| Service | PascalCase + Service | `GasService` |
| Guard | camelCase + Guard | `authGuard` |
| Model/Interface | PascalCase | `Gas`, `Customer` |
| File | kebab-case.type.ts | `gas-card.component.ts` |

---

# Import Aliases

```typescript
import { AuthService } from '@core/auth';
import { ButtonComponent } from '@shared/components/ui';
import { Gas } from '@models/gas.model';
import { environment } from '@env';
```

